        "TileImage": "$($repository 8b29da09-461f-44d7-9042-d4fde829b9f2).Image",
        "Description": "FROM: Diana Burnwood\rTO: Tobias Rieper\r\r47, we do not have much time. Act promptly after reading this email.\r\rIntelligence reveals that more FRANCHISE members are currently on our tails, undercovering at a Berlin&apos;s nightclub. The place is lively, albeit not as much as the Meat King&apos;s party. Their hunt is not yet active, so we must take advantage.\r\rWe will want to make an impressive exampli gracia, 47, so I suggest you become a crowd-pleaser. Do not leave behind naked bodies.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
